WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.562
This is the completion page for Module 6 and Assignment 5.

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:07.987
The module tracks ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises.

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:14.412
Before selecting Complete Module, review the counters and make sure they reflect the work you intended to

00:00:14.412 --> 00:00:19.947
complete. If an activity is incomplete, the page lists it and lets you return to the relevant slide.

00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:26.767
When you select Complete Module, the page creates a Canvas submission summary containing your completion

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:31.177
status, knowledge-check answers, and the SQL saved for each coding exercise.

00:00:31.177 --> 00:00:36.207
Review the generated Assignment 5 summary before copying it into Canvas.

00:00:36.207 --> 00:00:42.412
If your work is incomplete, the page will warn you, but it can still include the answers and

00:00:42.412 --> 00:00:43.822
SQL you have completed so far.

00:00:43.822 --> 00:00:47.522
Remember that progress is stored locally in the current browser.

00:00:47.522 --> 00:00:54.887
Switching devices, using a private browsing window, or clearing browser storage may remove that saved

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:58.087
progress. Treat this final page as quality control.

00:00:58.087 --> 00:01:02.937
In professional data work, checking the output before submitting or publishing is just as important as writing

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.248
the query.
